{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CggBAxVNUrK5F5KEMaB2d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No tool in this session can query GTEx, HPA, or any expression database — this is answered from my own knowledge, not a lookup.\n\n**Insulin (gene *INS*, Ensembl ENSG00000254647, chr11p15.5) is expressed overwhelmingly in the pancreas**, and within it specifically the **beta cells of the islets of Langerhans**. In bulk-tissue atlases (GTEx, Human Protein Atlas consensus), pancreas INS expression exceeds every other tissue by roughly 3–4 orders of magnitude; insulin mRNA is among the most abundant transcripts in whole pancreas despite islets being only ~1–2% of pancreatic mass.\n\nTwo caveats worth noting:\n\n- **Bulk pancreas understates beta-cell levels.** Because the exocrine acinar tissue dominates pancreatic RNA, single-cell data (e.g. Baron et al. 2016, Segerstolpe et al. 2016) place INS at an even more extreme fraction of the transcriptome in beta cells specifically.\n- **Low-level extra-pancreatic expression is real.** The best-documented secondary site is the **thymus**, where AIRE-driven INS expression in medullary thymic epithelial cells mediates central tolerance to insulin — functionally important in type 1 diabetes (the *INS* VNTR at the IDDM2 locus modulates thymic INS levels). Trace signal is also reported in brain and testis, but these are far below pancreas.\n\nI have not verified the specific median TPM value here, so I'm deliberately not quoting one; if you want the exact figure, the GTEx portal entry for ENSG00000254647 is the source to check.\n\n## ANSWER\n\n**Pancreas** — specifically the beta cells of the pancreatic islets of Langerhans (gene *INS*, ENSG00000254647). Expression there exceeds all other human tissues by ~1000-fold or more; the main secondary site is the thymus (AIRE-driven, at very low levels)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18903,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":18903},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7e066298-cd73-49c8-b402-7d9584b13300","uuid":"f199e6f2-80f1-415f-b30e-2831d73e06a4","timestamp":"2026-11-03T14:46:43.394Z","request_id":"req_011CggBAxCWbcjxtmYiQZEtT"}
